      "en": "Want to quit but afraid of bad timing? Astrology can help. Saturn returns, Jupiter transits, and Uranus changes all signal career shifts. Here's how to read your window.",
      "id": "Ingin berhenti tapi takut masa salah? Astrologi boleh membantu. Kembalinya Zuhal, transit Musytari, dan perubahan Uranus semuanya isyarat perubahan kerjaya.",
