      "en": "# Soulmate Initial Reading: Free Astrology Guide to Your Future Partner's First Letter\n\n\"What will his name be?\"\n\nEvery woman has wondered this. Maybe you've done the TikTok filters, the BuzzFeed quizzes, the palm reading at the county fair.\n\nWhile no astrology placement can give you an exact name, your chart can narrow down the energy — and the initials — of the person you're most likely to build a lasting relationship with.\n\n## How It Works\n\nThree parts of your chart point to your partner's energy:\n\n1. **Your Venus sign** — what you're attracted to\n2. **Your 7th house cusp** — the type of person you commit to\n3. **Your Descendant** — the qualities you seek in a partner\n\nEach zodiac sign has a vibrational frequency that corresponds to certain letters. Here's the guide:\n\n## Aries (March 21 - April 19)\n\n**Energy:** Bold, direct, pioneering, energetic\n**Likely initials:** A, J, M, R\n**Names:** Alex, James, Michael, Ryan, Andrew, Jacob, Matthew, Robert\n\nIf your Venus or 7th house is in Aries, your soulmate is likely someone who takes charge, moves fast, and isn't afraid to make the first move.\n\n## Taurus (April 20 - May 20)\n\n**Energy:** Stable, sensual, reliable, patient\n**Likely initials:** B, E, L, V\n**Names:** Brian, Ethan, Liam, Vincent, Benjamin, Elijah, Lucas, Victor\n\nTaurus energy draws you to someone grounded, loyal, and who appreciates the finer things in life.\n\n## Gemini (May 21 - June 20)\n\n**Energy:** Curious, witty, communicative, versatile\n**Likely initials:** C, G, K, T\n**Names:** Chris, Gavin, Kevin, Tyler, Caleb, Gabriel, Kyle, Thomas\n\nGemini energy means your person is smart, talkative, and keeps you mentally stimulated.\n\n## Cancer (June 21 - July 22)\n\n**Energy:** Nurturing, emotional, protective, family-oriented\n**Likely initials:** D, H, N, W\n**Names:** David, Henry, Noah, William, Daniel, Harrison, Nathan, Wyatt\n\nCancer energy draws you to someone caring, home-focused, and emotionally available.\n\n## Leo (July 23 - August 22)\n\n**Energy:** Confident, charismatic, generous, dramatic\n**Likely initials:** A, L, O, S\n**Names:** Adam, Leo, Oliver, Samuel, Anthony, Lucas, Oscar, Sebastian\n\nLeo energy means your person is confident, warm, and loves to be admired.\n\n## Virgo (August 23 - September 22)\n\n**Energy:** Analytical, practical, helpful, detail-oriented\n**Likely initials:** E, I, P, V\n**Names:** Ethan, Ian, Peter, Victor, Eric, Isaac, Patrick, Vincent\n\nVirgo energy draws you to someone reliable, intelligent, and who takes care of the details.\n\n## Libra (September 23 - October 22)\n\n**Energy:** Charming, diplomatic, romantic, balanced\n**Likely initials:** B, J, R, T\n**Names:** Brandon, Justin, Ryan, Tyler, Blake, Jacob, Robert, Thomas\n\nLibra energy means your person is charming, romantic, and values harmony.\n\n## Scorpio (October 23 - November 21)\n\n**Energy:** Intense, mysterious, passionate, transformative\n**Likely initials:** D, M, P, S\n**Names:** Dylan, Marcus, Philip, Sean, Daniel, Matthew, Paul, Steven\n\nScorpio energy draws you to someone deep, intense, and magnetic.\n\n## Sagittarius (November 22 - December 21)\n\n**Energy:** Adventurous, optimistic, philosophical, free-spirited\n**Likely initials:** A, F, J, S\n**Names:** Aaron, Finn, Jake, Sam, Andrew, Felix, Joseph, Shane\n\nSagittarius energy means your person is fun, adventurous, and loves to explore.\n\n## Capricorn (December 22 - January 19)\n\n**Energy:** Ambitious, disciplined, responsible, mature\n**Likely initials:** C, G, M, V\n**Names:** Christopher, George, Mark, Vincent, Charles, Grant, Matthew, Victor\n\nCapricorn energy draws you to someone driven, reliable, and goal-oriented.\n\n## Aquarius (January 20 - February 18)\n\n**Energy:** Independent, innovative, intellectual, unconventional\n**Likely initials:** A, G, K, W\n**Names:** Adam, Gabriel, Kyle, Wyatt, Alexander, Gavin, Kevin, William\n\nAquarius energy means your person is unique, smart, and a little unconventional.\n\n## Pisces (February 19 - March 20)\n\n**Energy:** Dreamy, compassionate, artistic, spiritual\n**Likely initials:** E, J, N, P\n**Names:** Ethan, James, Noah, Philip, Evan, Jason, Nicholas, Patrick\n\nPisces energy draws you to someone sensitive, creative, and emotionally deep.\n\n## How to Find Yours\n\n1. Generate your free birth chart\n2. Find your Venus sign\n3. Find your 7th house sign\n4. Find your Descendant sign\n5. Look up the initials for each sign\n6. The overlap is your soulmate's likely initial range\n\n## Important Disclaimer\n\nThis is a fun guide, not a guarantee. Names are cultural and personal. Your chart shows the *energy* of your partner, not their exact name. But you might be surprised how often the initials align.\n\nThe real value is in understanding what kind of person you're drawn to — so you can recognize them when they appear.\n\n[Generate Your Free Birth Chart →](/natal)\n\nFor a deep, personalized soulmate reading — including your exact compatibility patterns, timing, and what to look for — unlock the AI Soulmate Report.\n\n[Unlock Your Soulmate Report · $19.99](https://hanhan55.gumroad.com/l/zgbent)\n\n## FAQ\n\n### Can astrology really predict my soulmate's name?\n\nNot exactly. Astrology shows the energy and qualities of your ideal partner, which can correlate with certain name vibrations. But names are cultural and personal — this is for fun and self-reflection.\n\n### What if my Venus, 7th house, and Descendant are all different signs?\n\nThat's normal! It means you're attracted to a range of qualities. Look for the overlap in initials, or consider that your partner may express multiple sign energies.\n\n### Do I have only one soulmate?\n\nMost astrologers believe we have multiple soulmates — some romantic, some platonic. Each one teaches us something different.\n\n### Can I use this to find my soulmate?\n\nUse it as a guide, not a filter. Don't reject someone because their name doesn't match. But do notice when someone's energy aligns with what your chart describes.\n\n## Related Articles\n\n- [How to Know If He Is Your Soulmate: 5 Astrology Signs](/blog/how-to-know-if-he-is-your-soulmate-astrology)\n- [When Will I Meet My Soulmate? Astrology Timing Guide](/blog/when-will-i-meet-my-soulmate-astrology)\n- [Twin Flame vs Soulmate: What's the Difference?](/blog/twin-flame-vs-soulmate-difference)"
